{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>וַאדֹנָי</b> — The meaning: that He decrees a decree upon it." "<b>וְתָמוֹג</b> — The opposite of its nature, for it is dry." "<b>וְאָבְלוּ כָּל־יֹשְׁבֵי בָהּ</b> — like the generation of the Flood." "<b>וְעָלְתָה</b> — and the meaning of וְעָלְתָה כַיְאוֹר: that it rises in Tammuz."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:40.456541778Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}